Problem      : Minimum Coins
Platform     : GeeksforGeeks

Difficulty   : Medium

Pattern      : Unbounded Knapsack DP

Approach     : Memoization / Tabulation / Space Optimization

Time          : O(N*Target)
Space         : O(N*Target)

Status              : ⭐ Must Revise
Frequently Asked    : ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
